{"4335920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neon Curves Racing", "steam_appid": 4335920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn rubber through glowing city circuits where speed, style, and attitude collide.<br><strong>Neon Curves Racing</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>top-down arcade racer</strong> wrapped in a vibrant <strong>kawaii neon aesthetic</strong>, blending tight racing mechanics with flashy customization and playful personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race hard, win big, and return to your garage to celebrate victories in true neon-soaked style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335920/extras/3f359f4764157808d77e93f5f04e3e17.poster.avif?t=1771193712\" width=602 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335920/extras/3f359f4764157808d77e93f5f04e3e17.webm?t=1771193712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335920/extras/3f359f4764157808d77e93f5f04e3e17.mp4?t=1771193712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏁 <strong>Arcade Racing, Refined</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, responsive <strong>top-down racing</strong> designed for pure fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift through sharp corners and master precision lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, adrenaline-fueled races perfect for quick sessions or long grinds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 <strong>Deep 3D Car Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully <strong>3D customizable car liveries</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change colors, materials, decals, and glow effec